  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_system_01",
      "hash64": "A8A6F5EA807AAAB3",
      "text": "제로랩의 게이트를 열겠습니까?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_system_02",
      "hash64": "A8A6F6EA807AAC66",
      "text": "...꾸욱!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_system_03",
      "hash64": "A8A6F7EA807AAE19",
      "text": "장기간 인증이 이뤄지지 않아\\n입구가 잠겼습니다.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_sister_01",
      "hash64": "B59D7DDD3BCB7818",
      "text": "어떻게 된 거야? 작동이 안 돼?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "4E2F8664BCE0CF56",
      "text": "전에는 열렸던 거지?\\n뭔가 조건이 다른 건가?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_select_01",
      "hash64": "C9FA8DC14333DF60",
      "text": "4개의 잠금장치!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_select_02",
      "hash64": "C9FA90C14333E479",
      "text": "안에 박사님이!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "4E2F8564BCE0CDA3",
      "text": "과연... 사전 준비와\\n안에 있는 사람의 도움이 있었구나.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_system_04",
      "hash64": "A8A6F8EA807AAFCC",
      "text": "...딩동!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_01",
      "hash64": "1A19826A4619A0FF",
      "text": "남청의디스크의\\n반응을 감지했습니다.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_02",
      "hash64": "1A19836A4619A2B2",
      "text": "남청의디스크의\\n반응을 감지했습니다.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_brother_01",
      "hash64": "1395092E5B93D9B2",
      "text": "우와아!\\n말을 하잖아!?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_03",
      "hash64": "1A19846A4619A465",
      "text": "남청의디스크를 슬롯에 삽입하면\\n접근 권한이 확대됩니다.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_04",
      "hash64": "1A197D6A46199880",
      "text": "남청의디스크를\\n삽입해 주십시오.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_sister_02",
      "hash64": "B59D80DD3BCB7D31",
      "text": "그냥 기계음이야.\\n기술머신머신이랑 비슷한데?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
